flowchart LR
  accTitle: Four B2 invariants and their dependency chain
  accDescr: Fan and Lan propose four linked runtime invariants. Typed diagnosis establishes why recovery is needed and defines its scope. A protected parent and bounded child substate isolate the recovery attempt. A typed result returns with evidence and dependency information and must be validated against the parent. Only a validated resolution and its necessary conditions may become a reusable recovery rule. This is a research hypothesis, not an established standard.
  A[Typed diagnosis] --> B[Protected parent + bounded substate]
  B --> C[Typed resolution return]
  C --> D[Parent and dependency validation]
  D --> E[Condition-safe compilation]
  E --> F[Reusable guarded recovery rule]
